SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE / THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

The MIT license above covers only the work made by That Guy (Coronerra):
the Papyrus scripts, the SkyrimNet prompt bundles, the OStim actor-property,
hub and forwarding-scene JSON written for this mod, the documentation and the
build notes.

Third-party assets and data remain the property of their original authors and
are NOT relicensed by this file. This includes (but is not limited to) meshes,
textures, animations and scene data derived from or pointing at:
- TWO - Total Werewolf Overhaul (Frosferes): referenced. Frosferes is okay
  with patches but I will not repackage any files he made that I did not have
  to patch. So non-softbody female bodies and all Male bodies are still
  dependant on his TWO bodies. Shipped TWO-derived files, each edited, at this
  mod's own paths: the softbody Yes copies of TWO's female body and hard
  canine, the two softbody SMP configs built from TWO's XMLs, and the BFA head
  TRI. They are not covered by the MIT license.
- Monster Facial Animation and Expressive Werebeasts (TealEri, aka
  CinnaMewRoll): referenced, not shipped (Vampire Lord meshes were bundled up
  to 0.7, not since 0.7.1).
- Animated Beast's Cocks (BakaFactory): the Growl option's sheath, tip and knot
  geometry.
- Animations by Billyy, Anub, FlufyFox (FluffyFox), BakaFactory, FunnyBizness,
  the More Nasty Critters team (Dayelyte, Panicforever) and MadMansGun. Their
  OStim conversions and packaging (including Werewolf and Vampire Lord OStim
  0.2.3) are by Lirael Atelier, who did not make the animations. Bundled:
  Billyy-derived fallback poses (Billyy has given full permission) and, since
  0.8, edited copies of Lirael's converted scene data (menu overrides and
  extra-cast scenes, no animation files). Up to 0.7.2: Billyy scene/hub files
  and edited copies of the Baka/FluffyFox/FunnyBiz scene files (hub routing).
- OCreatures (J0suk3_), OCreatures Revived (chrystelle) and OCreatures
  Reforged (Lirael Atelier): edited copies of the idle/hub scene files.
- GT - Softbody (Goutou): the softbody canal setup follows it (its werewolf
  cock meshes and the More Nasty Critters textures were shipped up to 0.7.1).
- OCum Ascended (Aietos, with OsmosisWrench and Sairion350): the werewolf
  urethra node is based on OCum's; softbody "Yes" ships a modified copy of
  OCum's OCumMaleScript (with Tull/Liquid code and the Scene Change Fix by
  Blacksheepo815, and GT Softbody's OCum fixes by Goutou).
- Growl (EnaiSiaion), JS Emissive Eyes (johnskyrim), OStim Standalone
  (Kannonfodder, VersuchDrei and the OStim team), Better Facial Animations
  (Cyberquach).
- Earlier versions only (0.1 to 0.6): HDT Werewolves (jacques00, Duzellx,
  Allegretto) and the Fluffworks shell-fur method (Macxhiin).
Full credits: README.md, section "Credits". Ask the respective authors before
redistributing their work.
